on class="lux-reader-section lux-product-story-media"><h2>产品说明</h2><p>独特的三角管状造型兼具辨识度与挂汁能力。采用 100% 意大利硬质小麦粗面粉和当地纯净泉水，经青铜模具拉制并在 40–45°C 下低温慢干 24–48 小时。</p><p>三角管状面有清晰的立体结构，适合搭配番茄、肉酱、奶油和烤蔬菜，也适合用于需要保持形状的焗烤菜式。</p><div class="lux-product-videos" aria-label="产品视频"><video data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/pasta/penne-triangolari.webp'); ?>" aria-label="斜管面 · 10 × 500 g 视频 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/7815584.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/pasta/penne-triangolari.webp'); ?>" aria-label="斜管面 · 10 × 500 g 视频 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/8107490.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="lux-product-video-notes"><p>管状或螺旋面需要让酱汁进入结构之中。翻拌时保留少量面水，可以让酱汁更顺滑，也更容易附着在面体的纹理上。</p></div><div class="lux-product-storage-gallery"><picture data-storage-image="0" class="is-active"><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/pasta-01-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/pasta-01.webp'); ?>" alt="斜管面 · 10 × 500 g · 料理应用参考 1"></picture><picture data-storage-image="1" class=""><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/pasta-02-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/pasta-02.webp'); ?>" alt="斜管面 · 10 × 500 g · 料理应用参考 2"></picture><picture da